{"id": "aebb65da-bb90-45fb-880e-7b30e7861c04", "slug": "wanderluxe-bespoke-travel-1", "title": "WanderLuxe - Bespoke Travel", "description": "Wanderluxe Bespoke Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"WanderLuxe - Bespoke Travel\"\ndescription: \"Wanderluxe Bespoke Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# WanderLuxe - Bespoke Travel\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 37; favorites: 11; remixes: 2.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nWanderluxe Bespoke Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nWanderLuxe Curated Journeys Experiences Destinations Journal Start Planning Designing the world's most exceptional journeys The Explorer GLOBE MEDIA voyageur Sanctuary Retreats & Spas ATELIER HOTELS We are a boutique tr…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Designing the world's most exceptional journeys; We are a boutique travel atelier crafting unforgettable itineraries..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #FAFAFA, accent #FFFFFF, background #FAFAFA, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>WanderLuxe - Bespoke Travel</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=Playfair+Display:wght@300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#fafafa] text-gray-900 antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-gray-200 selection:text-gray-900\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\\'20\\' height=\\'20\\' viewBox=\\'0 0 20 20\\' xmlns=\\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\'%3E%3Cpath d=\\'M0 20L20 0\\' stroke=\\'%23000000\\' stroke-width=\\'1\\' stroke-opacity=\\'0.02\\' fill=\\'none\\' fill-rule=\\'evenodd\\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E');\">\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-50 p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full border border-gray-900/5\">\n            <!-- Corner L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-gray-900/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-gray-900/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-gray-900/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-gray-900/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8 pt-4\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 shadow-2xl h-[75vh] min-h-[500px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- WebGL/Canvas Animation Background -->\n            <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Hero Image Asset (Mask removed) -->\n            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/03a48a8d-d063-45ae-9446-eddb1ddf225f_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Modern glass villa in lush landscape\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0 scale-105\" style=\"transform-origin: center; animation: slowZoom 20s ease-out infinite alternate;\">\n\n            <!-- Header / Nav -->\n            <header class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full p-6 md:p-10 flex justify-between items-center z-20\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white drop-shadow-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg tracking-wide\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">WanderLuxe</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-white drop-shadow-md font-normal\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300\">Curated Journeys</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300\">Experiences</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300\">Destinations</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white/80 transition-colors duration-300\">Journal</a>\n                </nav>\n\n                <!-- Border Gradient Button -->\n                <div class=\"relative group p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white/20 via-white/50 to-white/20 overflow-hidden hidden sm:block shadow-lg\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-gray-900 text-sm font-normal rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[0.98]\">\n                        Start Planning\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Hero Content -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 text-center px-4 max-w-3xl mt-12 drop-shadow-xl\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mask-reveal-text font-normal\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                    Designing the world's<br>most exceptional<br>journeys\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Partner Logos Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto pt-24 pb-16 px-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-12 gap-y-8 opacity-40 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-700\">\n            <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl italic tracking-tighter\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">The Explorer</div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-normal text-lg tracking-tighter\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-current opacity-20\"></div>GLOBE MEDIA</div>\n            <div class=\"text-2xl font-light tracking-widest lowercase\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">voyageur</div>\n            <div class=\"text-sm tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-center leading-tight\">Sanctuary<br><span class=\"text-[0.6em] tracking-widest opacity-60\">Retreats &amp; Spas</span></div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg tracking-wider\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">ATELIER <span class=\"text-xs opacity-50 ml-1\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">HOTELS</span></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Main Copy Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center py-16 px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-5xl text-gray-900 leading-[1.2] tracking-tight mask-reveal-text font-normal\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">\n                We are a boutique travel atelier<br>crafting unforgettable itineraries.\n            </h2>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Image Trio Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative max-w-5xl mx-auto h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] md:h-[600px] flex justify-center items-center mt-8 mb-24\">\n\n            <!-- Left Image -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-4 sm:left-[10%] md:left-[20%] w-[45%] max-w-[280px] aspect-[4/5] -rotate-6 z-10 transform-gpu hover:z-40 hover:scale-105 hover:-rotate-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gray-200 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl border-[6px] sm:border-[10px] border-white shadow-xl overflow-hidden relative group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gray-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10\"></div>\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/3186f9ea-5f5a-49f7-8fcf-568ad52f515e_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Portrait at destination\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center Image -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[55%] max-w-[340px] aspect-[4/5] z-30 transform-gpu hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\">\n                <!-- Border Gradient on the center card for premium feel -->\n                <div class=\"p-[2px] rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-200 via-white to-gray-200 shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-white rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl border-[6px] sm:border-[10px] border-white overflow-hidden relative\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Futuristic destination\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Image -->\n            <div class=\"absolute right-4 sm:right-[10%] md:right-[20%] w-[45%] max-w-[280px] aspect-[4/5] rotate-6 z-20 transform-gpu hover:z-40 hover:scale-105 hover:rotate-2 transition-all duration-500 ease-out\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gray-200 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl border-[6px] sm:border-[10px] border-white shadow-xl overflow-hidden relative group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gray-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10\"></div>\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0d868fef-f560-45ca-ab35-5dad4fc29059_3840w.webp\" alt=\"Traveler portrait\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-top\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Secondary Copy Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center pb-32 px-4\">\n            <p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-800 leading-relaxed mask-reveal-text tracking-tight font-normal\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">\n                Our global network of experts curates highly personalized journeys—unlocking private access, cultural immersion, and secluded sanctuaries across the globe.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Inline Styles for specific animations -->\n    <style>\n        @keyframes slowZoom {\n            0% { transform: scale(1); }\n            100% { transform: scale(1.08); }\n        }\n\n        /* Utility for GSAP text masking */\n        .mask-word-container {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n            padding-bottom: 0.1em; /* Prevent descender clipping */\n            margin-right: 0.25em;\n        }\n        .mask-word-container:last-child {\n            margin-right: 0;\n        }\n        .mask-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal Logic\n            const splitTextToWords = (selector) => {\n                const elements = document.querySelectorAll(selector);\n\n                elements.forEach(el => {\n                    let htmlContent = el.innerHTML;\n                    htmlContent = htmlContent.replace(/<br\\s*[\\/]?>/gi, ' [BR] ');\n\n                    const words = htmlContent.split(/\\s+/).filter(word => word.trim().length > 0);\n\n                    let newHtml = '';\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                        if (word === '[BR]') {\n                            newHtml += '<br>';\n                        } else {\n                            newHtml += `<span class=\"mask-word-container\"><span class=\"mask-word\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                        }\n                    });\n\n                    el.innerHTML = newHtml;\n\n                    const wordElements = el.querySelectorAll('.mask-word');\n\n                    gsap.to(wordElements, {\n                        y: \"0%\",\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        stagger: 0.03,\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: \"top 85%\",\n                        }\n                    });\n                });\n            };\n\n            // Execute the text reveal\n            splitTextToWords('.mask-reveal-text');\n\n            // 2. Subtle WebGL-style Canvas Fluid/Particle Animation for Hero Background\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let width, height;\n            let particles = [];\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                width = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth;\n                height = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\n            };\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            class Particle {\n                constructor() {\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                    this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                    this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                    this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                    this.size = Math.random() * 2 + 1;\n                    this.color = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${Math.random() * 0.3 + 0.1})`;\n                    this.angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                }\n\n                update() {\n                    this.angle += 0.01;\n                    this.x += Math.cos(this.angle) * 0.5 + this.vx;\n                    this.y += Math.sin(this.angle) * 0.5 + this.vy;\n\n                    if (this.x < 0) this.x = width;\n                    if (this.x > width) this.x = 0;\n                    if (this.y < 0) this.y = height;\n                    if (this.y > height) this.y = 0;\n                }\n\n                draw() {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = this.color;\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            const initParticles = () => {\n                particles = [];\n                const numParticles = Math.min(width * height / 10000, 150);\n                for (let i = 0; i < numParticles; i++) {\n                    particles.push(new Particle());\n                }\n            };\n\n            initParticles();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                    for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                        const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                        const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                        const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                        if (dist < 100) {\n                            ctx.beginPath();\n                            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${0.1 * (1 - dist/100)})`;\n                            ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                            ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                            ctx.stroke();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    p.update();\n                    p.draw();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Parallax effect on image trio on scroll\n            gsap.to('.absolute.left-4, .absolute.left-\\\\[10\\\\%\\\\]', {\n                y: -30,\n                ease: \"none\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".relative.max-w-5xl\",\n                    scrub: true\n                }\n            });\n            gsap.to('.absolute.right-4, .absolute.right-\\\\[10\\\\%\\\\]', {\n                y: 30,\n                ease: \"none\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".relative.max-w-5xl\",\n                    scrub: true\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "wanderluxe-bespoke-travel-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/wanderluxe-bespoke-travel-1.jpg", "source_name": "wanderluxe-bespoke-travel-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 506, "forks": 35, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T22:20:54.391929+00:00"}